<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Career Paths in Computer Science</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff7ed;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #b56308;
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        .career {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 18px 0;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border-top: 5px solid #b56308;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #b56308;
        }

        ul {
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🚀 Career Paths in Computer Science</h1>

    <div class="career">
        <h2>💻 Software Developer</h2>
        <p>Develops and maintains software applications.</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Programming</li>
            <li>Problem Solving</li>
            <li>Testing</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="career">
        <h2>🌐 Web Developer</h2>
        <p>Creates and maintains websites and web applications.</p>

        <ul>
            <li>HTML</li>
            <li>CSS</li>
            <li>Web Design</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="career">
        <h2>🗄️ Database Professional</h2>
        <p>Works with databases and helps manage stored information.</p>

        <ul>
            <li>SQL</li>
            <li>Database Design</li>
            <li>Data Management</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="career">
        <h2>🔐 Cybersecurity Professional</h2>
        <p>Works on protecting systems, networks and information.</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Security Concepts</li>
            <li>Networking</li>
            <li>Risk Awareness</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
